Healthcare Data Analyst

We are seeking a Healthcare Data Analyst to join our organization. This role focuses on turning healthcare data into actionable insights to support decision making, quality improvement, and operational efficiency.

About the Role
The Healthcare Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyzes, and interprets data from multiple sources within the healthcare domain. You will develop and maintain data models, data pipelines, and reporting dashboards to inform clinical and administrative decision making while ensuring data quality, privacy, and security. You will translate business questions into data-driven analyses, deliver insights through visualizations and reports, and collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive improvements.

