What You Will Do
- Collect, clean, and harmonize healthcare data from diverse sources
- Develop data models, pipelines, and data products to support reporting and analysis
- Create dashboards and reports to communicate key metrics and insights
- Monitor data quality and implement data governance and standards compliance
- Conduct statistical analyses to inform clinical and operational decisions
- Translate use cases into actionable analyses in collaboration with stakeholders
- Lead or contribute to data-related projects and provide project status reports

What We Offer
